    "searchText": "foxwell enforcement careercontract orange level contract: destroy outlaw threat foxwellenforcement_shipwaveattack_clearouthostiles_stanton_m foxwell enforcement careercontract standing mercenary pickup: stanton a splinter group of outlaws have broken off from one of the main gangs in the system and have been trying to strike out on their own. with the amount of trouble they've been causing its clear they're looking to establish a name for themselves as quickly as they can. it's going to be up to you and your support crew to put a stop to them.\n\nonce your crew is ready, head over to [location] and engage with the gang. not all of them will just be waiting there on site. expect reinforcements to arrive once you begin your assault. just be sure to stay until every last one of them has been take care of.\n \ngood luck,\n\nmarcus clenn\nfoxwell enforcement\n'security, your way'\n\nfoxwell enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the uee. we are always looking for new operators to join our family. if you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives.\" orange level contract: take out criminal fleet yellow level contract: clear shipjacking group yellow level contract: neutralize shipjacking gang 30166c56-392f-4090-91ae-189a538275d5 b7f13ef2-3122-4d78-9777-fdf36e7bd3dc b08f5fae-7dd8-4d51-a3df-ae71623d382e e63947e0-f57d-4ca2-8947-4fd2f9d9e80d blueprint: foxwell defend entities and escort: parallax energy assault rifle, antium arms, antium core, antium legs +2 standing +150 credits formula unresolved standing +200 standing +100"
